Vendored from https://github.com/ozkl/doomgeneric (GPL-2.0, see LICENSE here),
directory doomgeneric/, upstream commit e257a09527062bfb986b6e5e0780839b6cbd5b71
(shallow clone, 2026-10-11).

Kept: the engine sources the upstream Makefile builds, minus the platform
frontends (doomgeneric_*.c) and the SDL/Allegro sound and music modules
(i_sdlsound.c, i_sdlmusic.c, i_allegro*.c), plus every header.

Local changes:
- i_sound.c: the SDL_mixer include is skipped when RS_RICH_DOOM is defined
  (this port's sound module, csrc/sound.c, needs no SDL).
Everything else is unmodified; console output and exit() are redirected at
build time by a force-included header (csrc/redirect.h), not by edits.
